step_details.raw_response:
Thought: Test a best_single strategy with FT_catboost to see if a single strong model beats the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"FT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a deterministic median combination on the most stable pool (pool1) to see if it improves over the global median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Try a trimmed mean over the full pool to see if trimming improves over the global median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a DBA (dynamic Bayesian averaging) on the most stable pool1 to see if Bayesian weighting improves over median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a deterministic median combination on pool2, which contains 7 models with better ranking stability.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Evaluate a DBA weighting on pool2 to see if dynamic Bayesian averaging improves over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a deterministic median combination on pool3 to see if it beats the global median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on the most stable pool3 to see if it beats the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","models":["catboost","CWT_rf","FT_rf","DWT_catboost","FT_catboost","ONLY_CWT_catboost"],"weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a simple mean combination over the largest pool (pool4) to see if averaging more models improves over median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a Dynamic Bayesian Averaging on pool3 to see if it improves over the median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a deterministic median on the largest pool (pool4) to see if adding the extra model improves over the global median baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool4"}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean combination on pool4 to see if trimming improves over median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool4","trim_pct":0.2}

